(7719820, 1270023, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love images like this with things falling.  I want to learn how to do this.<br/> <br/>To me, this isn''t a good still life since you''re purposefully adding "motion" to it, but...  I love it and I''m not voting.  :D</td>', 'I love images like this with things falling.  I want to learn how to do this. To me, this isn''t a good still life since you''re purposefully adding "motion" to it, but...  I love it and I''m not voting.  :D', '2022-05-06 11:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
